Meta.documentation:Number.ceil
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Rounds each Number up to an integer.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Streaming operator: toward positive infinity (ceil(1.2) is 2, ceil(−1.5) is −1).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_$all — each Number
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number — the rounded-up result
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:Number:-1.5>>Number.ceil:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:-1
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.floor Number.round
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
